{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:21c7121ccbbb5355","name":"Old Republic Lieutenant","source":{"id":"source:reference-21c7121ccbbb5355","title":"Old Republic Lieutenant","revision":19274,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:38:32Z","sha256":"9503e72c83d85a546f494ef38f8426957af1d76b803c3f4c6e14f1eab6b34b56","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19274","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Old%20Republic%20Lieutenant&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-21c7121ccbbb5355","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["\"",{"tag":"i","children":["The galaxy will run out of stars to visit before the Navy runs out of Lieutenants."]},"\" This aphorism is not mathematically true, but it reflects the state of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," bridges during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Restoration Period"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Restoration_Period"},". Midship graduates from the Academy regard their careers as over if they do not make Lieutenant after a year on a ship, and Lieutenant is the most common rank noncommissioned crew members receive when promoted to the bridge. The result is an odd split between very young Lieutenants and experienced older Lieutenants who started out below decks.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Bridge duty for Lieutenants ranges from communications to gunnery control to hyperspace navigation. Lieutenants also find many opportunities off-ship. Those with piloting experience assist with spacecraft and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," patrols, and those with combat skills join surface parties in securing landing sites. At most of the smaller Naval shipyards, the stationmaster is an older Lieutenant; these positions, however important, tend to be dumping grounds for those who have found further promotion impossible.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Lieutenants are easily the most avid audience of the official communique of the Republic Navy, ",{"tag":"i","children":["The Admiral's List"]},". A mention there makes a career, and graduates of the same class compete to see how many commendations they can receive.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Old Republic Lieutenant Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 4/",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Officer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officer","referenceId":"reference:192135a8adabe174"}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +4; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Bocce, Durese, Zabrak\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children"